before	<col=800000>The ability to defeat a level 111 Tanglefoot with limited weaponry</col>
step	1	10	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Martin the Master Gardener</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col> told me that crops all over <col=800000>Gielinor</col> are dying. He asked me to question members of the Group of Advanced Gardeners about it.</col>
step	2	20	After questioning the gardeners
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<col=000080>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. <col=800000>Martin</col> sent me to <col=800000>Zanaris</col> to find out what is going on. I should go to <col=800000>Zanaris</col> and speak to the <col=800000>Fairy Queen</col>.</col>
step	3	30	After speaking to the Godfather
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Fairy Queen</col> has fallen ill, and the <col=800000>Fairy Godfather</col> has taken over <col=800000>Zanaris</col>. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen. I should ask <col=800000>Fairy Nuff</col> about the queen's illness.</col>
step	4	40	After getting the symptoms list
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<str>The Fairy Queen has fallen ill, and the Fairy Godfather has taken over Zanaris. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Fairy Nuff</col> wrote me a list of the queen's symptoms. Someone who knows about dark magic might recognise them.</col>
step	5	50	After speaking to Zandar
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<str>The Fairy Queen has fallen ill, and the Fairy Godfather has taken over Zanaris. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen.</str>
line	<str>Fairy Nuff wrote me a list of the queen's symptoms.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Zandar Horfyre</col> in the <col=800000>Dark Wizards' Tower</col> read the list and named <col=800000>Malignius Mortifer</col> as someone who could help. I should find <col=800000>Malignius Mortifer</col>.</col>
step	6	60	After speaking to Malignius
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<str>The Fairy Queen has fallen ill, and the Fairy Godfather has taken over Zanaris. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen.</str>
line	<str>Fairy Nuff wrote me a list of the queen's symptoms.</str>
line	<str>Zandar Horfyre in the Dark Wizards' Tower read the list and named Malignius Mortifer as someone who could help.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Malignius Mortifer</col> took a <col=800000>Draynor skull</col> and told me the three items I need to bless a pair of secateurs. I should take <col=800000>Secateurs</col> and those items to the <col=800000>Nature Spirit</col>.</col>
step	7	70	After getting the magic secateurs
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<str>The Fairy Queen has fallen ill, and the Fairy Godfather has taken over Zanaris. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen.</str>
line	<str>Fairy Nuff wrote me a list of the queen's symptoms.</str>
line	<str>Zandar Horfyre in the Dark Wizards' Tower read the list and named Malignius Mortifer as someone who could help.</str>
line	<str>Malignius Mortifer took a Draynor skull and told me the three items I need to bless a pair of secateurs.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Nature Spirit</col> turned the secateurs and items into <col=800000>Magic secateurs</col>. With them I can hurt the <col=800000>Tanglefoot</col>, which guards the queen's secateurs at the end of the shady grove beyond the gap west of the <col=800000>Cosmic Altar</col>.</col>
step	8	80	After killing the Tanglefoot
line	<str>Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village told me that crops all over Gielinor are dying.</str>
line	<str>The gardeners told me that fairies have been seen near the dying crops. Martin sent me to Zanaris to find out what is going on.</str>
line	<str>The Fairy Queen has fallen ill, and the Fairy Godfather has taken over Zanaris. He explained that the queen's magic secateurs were stolen.</str>
line	<str>Fairy Nuff wrote me a list of the queen's symptoms.</str>
line	<str>Zandar Horfyre in the Dark Wizards' Tower read the list and named Malignius Mortifer as someone who could help.</str>
line	<str>Malignius Mortifer took a Draynor skull and told me the three items I need to bless a pair of secateurs.</str>
line	<str>The Nature Spirit turned the secateurs and items into Magic secateurs.</str>
line	<col=000080>I killed the <col=800000>Tanglefoot</col> and found the <col=800000>Queen's secateurs</col>. I should take them to the <col=800000>Fairy Godfather</col>.</col>
